{"528300": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Soulless: Ray Of Hope", "steam_appid": 528300, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A Story-Driven 2D Platformer</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Soulless: Ray of Hope</strong> is a 2D platformer centered on exploration, atmosphere, and narrative rather than fast reflex combat. Players guide a lone character through a dark and minimalistic world, uncovering fragments of story through environments and subtle interactions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The experience is designed to be reflective and emotional, inviting players to absorb the world at their own pace.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Exploration and Environmental Puzzles</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gameplay focuses on platforming challenges, light puzzle elements, and traversal. Progress comes from observation and experimentation rather than precision timing or difficulty spikes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There is minimal guidance, encouraging players to explore and interpret the world organically as the story unfolds.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A Minimalist and Emotional Experience</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Soulless: Ray of Hope uses restrained visuals and sound design to create a somber, introspective tone. Themes of loss, hope, and perseverance are conveyed through the environment rather than explicit dialogue or exposition.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a <strong>short, narrative-focused single-player experience</strong> intended for players who enjoy atmospheric games and visual storytelling.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2D platformer with a strong narrative focus</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Exploration-driven gameplay with light puzzles</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Minimalist visuals and sound design</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dark, emotional atmosph